        <p>Hello. I'm Kevin Hu, a Computer Information Technology student at BCIT. I've been tinkering with computers and software since I was a teenager, and that led me into video production, web development, and systems work. Over time, I also grew YouTube channels to more than 25,000 subscribers, which taught me how to plan, edit, and finish projects end to end.
